@startuml sequence-diagram-UC-005
title Sequence UC-005 Buscar, filtrar y paginar — FR-009/FR-010 / NFR-001
actor "Lector autenticado" as Actor
participant "JwtAuthGuard\n(Adapter)" as Guard
participant "MaterialsController\n(Adapter)" as Ctrl
participant "SearchCatalogUseCase\n(Controller)" as UC
participant "MaterialRepository\n(port)" as Repo
database "MariaDB 11\nFULLTEXT + BTREE" as DB

Actor -> Ctrl : GET /material?q=&author=&subject=&year=&yearFrom=&yearTo=&edition=&tag=&page=&limit= (JWT)
' GRASP Indirection — Mission: both sides depend on something stable
Guard -> Ctrl : verify(token) [401 primero, BR-002]
Ctrl -> UC : execute(query)
' GRASP Information Expert — Mission: co-locate behavior with information
UC -> UC : normaliza paginación (default 1/10, máx 50) y rango year [400]
' GRASP Protected Variations -> GoF Strategy — Mission: predicted instability never leaks to clients
UC -> Repo : search(filters, page, limit) [composición de filtros AND]
Repo -> DB : COUNT(*) + SELECT ... ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT/OFFSET (RST-004)
note over DB
  q -> FULLTEXT MATCH ... AGAINST('term*' BOOLEAN) — token/prefijo (ADR-0006).
  ATENCION: q infijo ('%q%') NO es index-servable; RE UC-005:20 debe
  redefinir q como token/prefijo (follow-up delta-spec) o aceptar scan.
  year/yearFrom/yearTo -> INDEX(year)
  tag repetible -> JSON_CONTAINS(tags, ?) — scan best-effort (tradeoff aceptado)
  orden v1 -> INDEX(created_at)
end note
DB --> Repo : total + filas
Repo --> UC : Page<Material> {items,total,page,limit}
UC --> Ctrl : Page
Ctrl --> Actor : 200 envelope {items,total,page,limit} (vacío -> items:[], total:0)

note over Actor, UC : NFR-001 p95<200ms respaldado por FULLTEXT + BTREE (ADR-0006); q vacío = sin filtro de texto
@enduml
